# <scope>: <summary>   (≤50 chars, imperative: "add", not "added")
#
# Why is this change needed? (the part the diff can't tell you later)
#
#
# How does it address it? Any caveats / follow-ups?
#
#
# --- guide (lines starting with # are stripped) ---
# scope = the feature/area touched, e.g.:
#   niri, yazi, gaming, pipewire, llm, hyprland, flake, hosts/styx
# One logical change per commit. Split unrelated changes.
# Summary: imperative mood, no trailing period, lowercase after scope.
# Wrap the body at ~72 cols. Explain WHY, not WHAT (git diff shows what).
